raw materials to craft tools, weapons, gear, and anything else you can imagine. Put these crafted items to use for your own purposes or sell them for a profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/a9c9fa3d9125163c47bb5f56c9ef6838.webp?t=1754768208\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/5e5f7a90ef1a436dadca14bec375e8bf.poster.avif?t=1754768208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/5e5f7a90ef1a436dadca14bec375e8bf.webm?t=1754768208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/5e5f7a90ef1a436dadca14bec375e8bf.mp4?t=1754768208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Purchase seeds from merchants, plant them in high-quality soil, add water, and patiently wait to harvest the results of your labor. You can sell your crops, use them in cooking, or even create special potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/297a625312850ff45b2399ddfa9b275a.webp?t=1754768208\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/ee77543dbc8dab6a7e178328af05927b.poster.avif?t=1754768208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/ee77543dbc8dab6a7e178328af05927b.webm?t=1754768208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/ee77543dbc8dab6a7e178328af05927b.mp4?t=1754768208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hunt wildlife and gather their meat to prepare food and open a new specialization. Your survival depends on filling up basic needs and protecting the store from bandits, ghostly soldiers, and cursed skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/a773862c8b39822f36b20e9d1e20e185.webp?t=1754768208\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate, operate, and grow your own shop in a medieval-inspired setting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage prices, attract customers, and work to increase the shop's reputation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of customization and decorating options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize in areas that align with your preferred gameplay style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the game's world, explore a hand-crafted map and delve into abandoned mine shafts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer services to the local community and complete quests.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of special in-game events for added opportunities and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your own animals and use their products to increase your profits.</p></li></ul>",
